      "hash": "4def77f9388809f53620144510fcc4b6f08662617bcc06a15abc618242e6544c"
    },
    {
      "id": "9d9598400961a49b5fca43a57572ab3057d9fff5c5cfbcd38a3a2c9474689948",
      "text": "Topics",
      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "06e053d44f8a734d868095f4ec47a427caa24eebbfaa80fff12d7782b850e30f",
      "text": "Free",
      "hash": "f411a1fb62758b4c54690d0a702b4955b54dd22115416fa7b1ce51b4a084818d"
    },
    {
      "id": "57baf125088cb7a86446e34c3e20d3161c31a6d2e5c57531de1125a1105a6538",
      "text": "Series · 16 lessons",
      "hash": "368efbeb9975601f6fbab7da7d3bef538b3d9a9169d9d3efba337f87d677e6eb"
    },
    {
      "id": "a79660dd96532d7fecfd9fbcb2a153f5acf4f08b0cc07d8b9f32d4d3d00710cc",
      "text": "Build any LLM app in TypeScript with Vercel's AI SDK. Learn streaming, structured outputs, tool calls and agents.",
      "hash": "ea177d847adbfa5a07e38106980e12ea604b0a379667793debcfe629a2c7d379"
    },
    {
      "id": "f626b745b0b1acc5514088db0dc1b0b826bb84b18bb299b6b72d75d2eaf4bfd0",
      "text": "Start lesson 1",
      "hash": "4807b65f9294479053540a531b017e8fc8e9abafa633eff06fc9e6f29557bf05"
    },
    {
      "id": "3acdc241966622083012c386954d7e6a351d4d66cd11d335bec03b23e4ff1ad9",
      "text": "Code",
      "hash": "340f463033e0fd5ddeabb922df4d4f1b5747494d0f5ed9894f13b6e13ca831f5"
    },
    {
      "id": "4e3fa72aa90529470241ceef1ae68b3ab903410d369f6ca862c136c0802f16a8",
      "text": "Share",
      "hash": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223"
    },
    {
      "id": "2bceeadacd3e6f7903ce2be5f4b018527aff5de12628a9f5cff0bdbf7f23231a",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6de61c80c8c2c3e66adcf1e2ddda3ee9ee2fab5fb3d919891cae7c886f87107",
      "text": "I've been building a lot of stuff with TypeScript and AI recently. I've been building agents, workflows, custom scripts and CLIs to help me work faster and smarter.",
      "hash": "f9d281738aa50c61712200989ed107ae0d63a2b8a34c20f1e8db53031bb7e5d2"
    },
    {
      "id": "761305ed534ba50eb62239d4110ee7081df76c7557eab8e92578b9906e4031e4",
      "text": "And Vercel's AI SDK has been an awesome tool in my toolkit.",
      "hash": "60f1cf008822df6c621b5ad1265fe1605873803eaecaaad13a223dd87dc66682"
    },
    {
      "id": "399a25b0daa1f7872d4dc9adb5bff9a29873652af4617e0a8812b06c435bed57",
      "text": "It's a library that solves a lot of the pain points when working with LLMs.",
      "hash": "14954145852faf40b6dbd0be6ca910918370d9f1df9abebbb69771b00ec72805"
    },
    {
      "id": "c09e13f9d5d29aa0e717f8c247502f16125aaaba01afde16084303c2f1a153d9",
      "text": "And in this tutorial, I'm going to give you a full guide on how to get to grips with it.",
      "hash": "d41de30bc50e3207c8570951fee07e8d7c9d13b20b2373d56384b14749aafd42"
    },
    {
      "id": "729d70fe0b8b311a2a71847a91a5394c94bda2e3f3f4b6f4d26f3883f5a6a827",
      "text": "This is really good! Learned a few things I didn't know.",
      "hash": "f456c26cc60b307ee7da1cac37c517cbc950a910712a6fa762f045dd40c4375c"
    },
    {
      "id": "1361e322e6a052d1a8aeba052009cad8348eb3c91826fe1ace77c03a369b3bab",
      "text": "Addy Osmani — Engineering leader @ Google Chrome",
      "hash": "600110aad0ac114598b1befb45b53cb0d2c5c161fd3edd11d8c756b21d807393"
    },
    {
      "id": "007bb5dbf96eb3eacef180ab3c45169c5e24be3832ae5d3b23d8a2e3464f0654",
      "text": "You can use the AI SDK Core anywhere JavaScript runs. And that's why I'm so excited about it. It's so versatile, so powerful and it's just the right level of abstraction for almost any task.",
      "hash": "5335bf2e414066e5e59096b577ebf76d8e4462255c7eb37256cd423a6018ad1e"
    },
    {
      "id": "121bfbec950f29942343765efd71ea2041ba865022fadff6802e503a3e10062a",
      "text": "Head to",
      "hash": "e09821d2451111ed94d62830c10f7e3e5745dd89da4292656a705beba2730b52"
    },
    {
      "id": "1e2a44abd6016499ec0ed8766a0bdd52da9a35080680350ecf1cdee7ee4b182f",
      "text": "AI Hero's GitHub Repo",
      "hash": "cfadee61a1a0629428861b78ede67b6afdff9f9973f337600245d233b1ef69fa"
    },
    {
      "id": "4b589483ac44d367221373b562ef82a1ed4fb44f6742c06d78dd476d2c6ad4cd",
      "text": "for all the code, and to run the examples.",
      "hash": "a551453bb47a0c30ba090a7721b4060e00396017032f3859ce16952e5c632af4"
    },
    {
      "id": "54c43c312a80805ae0b4e9429db0ca4633056a3fded33bf8d2c064957accae28",
      "text": "What you'll learn",
      "hash": "1c1710e31c7cf7c4421ebf663e9209d95ec55b980e98f279320019664bbd157e"
    },
    {
      "id": "9a27f30a15bd38251895422599f3e9a321d77fef8dbc16cca39a7c07d755724f",
      "text": "Hot-swapping models",
      "hash": "de69efb5d8cc9af00a7777cd63e02fb05407cd1d34439c4d6b35af1e216af65b"
    },
    {
      "id": "714fc6895d7478bbabac9a04288232b96471d1a6cbdc8b3cc45569b81ccc57b7",
      "text": "Streaming",
      "hash": "a951c5945635e2d32e944bf67ddf3101bc3c5c9b2e3087ef39c384dc0e61a0d0"
    },
    {
      "id": "30a2f238105ab99e73cab7c71aaaee349adcdffcc7232ee40f81373e055bd344",
      "text": "Structured outputs",
      "hash": "88b38235d4b59b6950b438ae2d43276bd3debfd5d0ff512001e1d586de4ee7bc"
    },
    {
      "id": "55315d14dede4db05b83609ffe8ba40a5c809ed7133b5007d81b432e7bdc7bcf",
      "text": "Handling images and files",
      "hash": "df4a554efd914f26f92254d724bf3da616a3ba09e1188518d78386ffb1815b36"
    },
    {
      "id": "77cedf1b0be1dea7c035f2b2607900396c42ebf7232e8e664f9ca8d0a4923c19",
      "text": "Tool calling",
      "hash": "10d67f48de9986c9925795e4b33ce7cb1fcb38a7ff54c5638c50e19a30399ecb"
    },
    {
      "id": "9b0184fd5e9998c6bead8e25ced786009235fe4966726123c63655cb55c411a8",
      "text": "Building agents",
      "hash": "c44eba196a4d505d8cc6e020dd61f7da91f60ecf7ab8131185032c34d76489ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2fa5a5fa6e0ed29b52905f693010c018c09832448cb5c7b730e4bfc9c071039",
      "text": ", in order",
      "hash": "68cba9003488304327954a8e8befa73118d6753600a5c8ba21d2b99194e0ee1e"
    },
    {
      "id": "beff23fa345f431c04416f2fa88cd5e6b14a00f760a7ee37ecce64ed10bea055",
      "text": "Learn how Vercel's AI SDK simplifies building AI apps by providing a unified API to interact with different LLM providers.",
      "hash": "70e6e8518148d88f9eb2e6b9ac70893230032a65cd91855520e7468531b8680d"
    },
    {
      "id": "12ed94af9ab767597ff9ab30a3341669ec90335aca136ead8f953f92991a25d6",
      "text": "Learn how to generate AI text responses using Vercel's AI SDK with Anthropic's Claude models. Simple setup for text generation in TypeScript.",
      "hash": "4e17633b370c8a36acc4dd193ec9e3c3b3e522d18153e09ae6c1c132964d088b"
    },
    {
      "id": "383b6c66cca2da1ba7e25ec0078239e1b80d5df61badcd83fe799eda5f19d2c6",
      "text": "Learn how to use Vercel's AI SDK to stream text to massively improve your user's experience.",
      "hash": "5192846db1ccd4a33e7be26547de89cf70068dfd2ffd7f6b3691772d8265016c"
    },
    {
      "id": "c25a4cb5a72690ff266e3b5761bf1f4c8b7576b6b37c61c2f89720052453a7a7",
      "text": "Learn how to use system prompts with Vercel's AI SDK to customise the LLM's behavior.",
      "hash": "4df8a6cc65c8083dbf2611efbde0e7b5a87667600eaeb653d16a664987c43892"
    },
    {
      "id": "00c3db46bd0ce6217ad93a5694998d8f88cb336be8db407b9ba150670e138377",
      "text": "Learn how to easily switch AI models using Vercel's AI SDK for flexible and decoupled application development.",
      "hash": "9dd75b93493c9b5b8154647515cdd8ce7c04669a0d5abbe1e1bad1df2409fb47"
    },
    {
      "id": "ed8ea07048a99041af7f245cad43abc93d9d170304fb08c1cb01fe951dc22c5b",
      "text": "Learn how to manage conversation history in AI chatbots using Vercel AI SDK's CoreMessage array. A practical guide with TypeScript examples.",
      "hash": "479c992b3ca7d14432b03786054bae3ea591fac235f0f3c513e391d5db4a450d"
    },
    {
      "id": "50b648bc1eaf78d9317d9d2dee55fa5dc6d704b2b1002241ab69affaf44c9dc1",
      "text": "Learn how to connect Vercel's AI SDK to local or remote models using OpenAI-compatible APIs, featuring LM Studio integration on localhost.",
      "hash": "b193029cd2af175bd3cedbd869140260ceec8e7b9518ce1cdfe5c049dd36261f"
    },
    {
      "id": "523943ef7c74c09af06f3eca6e447a848e66404be361b9d73e5617c59ecc4ba8",
      "text": "Discover how to use Vercel's AI SDK for structured outputs with OpenAI, focusing on efficient data retrieval in predefined formats.",
      "hash": "1fbcb03b242d85e4fb61f81825d262d16fbc5a535924666cb157c1638a24e7af"
    },
    {
      "id": "193552032078e8d95f46bb0d1ba95e8f1070286bd43bc7aa025890b959bb1ce2",
      "text": "Learn how to stream structured outputs from an LLM using Vercel's AI SDK.",
      "hash": "326aa7019edbdd7c061f05d21ceb0e7c9a46c88829ec41ae4da5a7931823c61a"
    },
    {
      "id": "c44b0b03320fc91b23d371fd14801bb289e922602e1ad74bbbf6f613dd8837ee",
      "text": "Learn how to build a sentiment analysis system using enums and the AI SDK to classify text as positive, negative, or neutral in just a few lines of code.",
      "hash": "0e98ceb8bf879f153d96c243fd0b75a33fed8b2a6dae97bde8c65484577e9bcc"
    },
    {
      "id": "9baae1a0568df86ac7a87a0fa7cf4ef86237f87fce04879b18bea3fb8a9579ef",
      "text": "Learn how to use Vercel's AI SDK to generate arrays of objects with a Zod schema for creating fake user data.",
