    },
    {
      "id": "75ce3c7c252d07a735da969ce479f182c8c56497c4a8ffb63746db9d3bf1d770",
      "text": "Let's build an AI agent. Learn how LLM's can respond to the results of tool calls with Vercel's AI SDK.",
